\title{RNAmel: downstream bulk RNA-seq analysis platform}
\description{
RNAmel is a modular Shiny application packaged as an R package for
downstream bulk RNA-seq analysis. It takes raw count matrices and
sample metadata as input and provides:
}
\details{
\itemize{
\item \strong{Differential expression} analysis with DESeq2 (LFC shrinkage,
independent filtering, custom contrasts)
\item \strong{Visualization}: interactive volcano plots, publication-ready heatmaps,
PCA scatter plots
\item \strong{Functional enrichment} (phase 3): GSEA / ORA against MSigDB, GO,
KEGG, Reactome
\item \strong{Co-expression network analysis} (phase 4): WGCNA modules with
trait correlations
\item \strong{Reproducible HTML reports} (phase 5): Quarto-rendered summaries
}

Supports human, mouse and rat organisms.

To launch the app: \code{RNAmel::run_app()}
}
